THIRD-PARTY ATTRIBUTION
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The download engine in this project is an independent TypeScript / Node.js
implementation whose architecture and scheduling strategy are based on a study
of the following project:

    YunX (云析) — an open-source network-drive share-link parser and
    high-speed downloader for Android.
    https://github.com/CYQawa/YunX
    Copyright (C) 2026 CYQawa
    Licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License, version 3.

YunX is licensed under AGPL-3.0. This project is a derivative work in the
sense that its design, chunk-planning policy, watchdog thresholds and
correctness rules were derived from reading YunX's source. In accordance with
the license:

  * This project is distributed under AGPL-3.0-or-later as well.
  * The complete corresponding source code is provided in this repository.
  * The original copyright notice and license are preserved here and in the
    header of every source file that implements the derived design.
  * A description of the changes made is available in README.md
    ("许可证与致谢") and docs/YUNX-ANALYSIS.md.

No source file from YunX (Kotlin) has been copied into this repository. The
implementation is written from scratch in TypeScript; only functional
constants and behavioural rules were carried over.

The analysis itself (docs/YUNX-ANALYSIS.md) quotes short excerpts of YunX
source for the purpose of comment and study, which is permitted by AGPL-3.0
section 2 and by applicable fair-use provisions.

